  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>새해는 </b><b>아니지만</b><br>&#160;<br><b>제 마음 속 &#39;새해&#39; 가&#160;</b><br><b>카운트다운에 들어갔네요.</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">첫 시간</span>에 뭐하지비.....</b><br>&#160;<br><b>좀, 쌈박한거 없나....</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>이것저것</b><br><b>뭐라도 <span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">수.업.실.험.해보기</span> 좋은 시간이</b><br><b>첫 시간이 아닌가 싶습니다.</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>안전교육도 해보고</b><br><b>탐구요소도 해보고</b><br><b>1년 소개도 해보고</b><br><b>겁도 줘보고</b><br><b>신나게 흥도 돋궈보고</b><br>&#160;<br><b>이것저것 해봤는데</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>올해는 이게 땡기네요 ㅋ</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">&lt;단원명 물화생지로 나누기&gt;</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>중2라, 물화생지를 아는 녀석들이 </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">간간히 있다</span>는 기대하에</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style6\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">준비물</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">단원명 인쇄물</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">4절지</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">3형제(풀-가위-매직)</span></b></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style6\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>1. 올해 배울 단원명이란다.&#160;</b><br><b>(조별로 A4 프린트 1장 투척!)</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e76d38d2006e4da5acf2fb0178d57096d0676bb\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"338\" height=\"481\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e76d38d2006e4da5acf2fb0178d57096d0676bb\" data-origin-width=\"516\" data-origin-height=\"734\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>2. 과학에는 (물화생지) 가 있지비~</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">3. 4절지에 일단 땡기는 대로 구분해볼래?</span></b><br><b>(오늘 미완성 조는 남아서</b><br><b>원소기호 시험 볼꺼임 ㅋ</b><br><b>협동을 좀 해보라는 뜻임 ㅋ)</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">4. 물화생지에 대한 설명도 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">4절지에 좀 써줄래?</span></b><br><b>&#160; &#160; &#160;네?????</b><br><b>&#160; &#160; &#160;<span data-ke-size=\"size18\">PPT 찬스 줄께 ㅋ</span></b><br><b>&#160; &#160; &#160;단, PPT는 5초씩만 보여줄꺼임</b><br><b>&#160; &#160; &#160;전략짜는 시간 1분! 스따뚜!</b><br><b>(찬스 PPT를 좀 잘 봐야하자너,</b><br><b>혼자서는 못하는거란다)</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">5. (1분) PPT 를</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">누가 어케 볼지 전략짜기&#160;</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b>6. PPT로 물화생지 설명 5초씩 보여주기<br>사실 5초는 택도 업슴다<br>아이들과 밀당하며 쪼매 더 ㅋ</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/88dc61fcef05b6e0e195133a93c7b324828bf9b9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/88dc61fcef05b6e0e195133a93c7b324828bf9b9\" data-origin-width=\"1066\" data-origin-height=\"586\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/448b71a6fc28ff75ae18ff7515dfbfe3a53bdcea\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/448b71a6fc28ff75ae18ff7515dfbfe3a53bdcea\" data-origin-width=\"1066\" data-origin-height=\"585\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d73ff9555685767fe9b7dd079623f683decf206e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d73ff9555685767fe9b7dd079623f683decf206e\" data-origin-width=\"1062\" data-origin-height=\"575\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16e1daf3b40803ace4e49ec4ae79422fe9f71caa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16e1daf3b40803ace4e49ec4ae79422fe9f71caa\" data-origin-width=\"1064\" data-origin-height=\"572\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">7. (교과서보고) 단원별 키워드도 써보세욤!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">8. 선입견 알아보기! </span></b><br><b>&#160; &#160; 조원과 합심하여</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">&#160; &#160; 망삘 단원 찾기!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b>9. 로테이션 하며, 다른 조 4절지 구경!</b><br>&#160;<br><b>10. 투표! and 보상!</b><br>&#160;<br><b>끗!</b><br>&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style2\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>예상되는 난관은,</b><br><b>시간부족. 입니다.</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>고민은 그저</b><br><b>스트레스만 쌓을뿐</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">다....</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">3월 4일의 내가 할껍니다.</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">(다같이 주문을...)</span></b><br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"> <b>3월 4일의 내가 할껍니다.</b> </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size14\"> <b>3월 4일의 내가 할껍니다.</b> </span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>해보신 슨생님 여러분,</b><br><b>보태어주신다면</b><br>&#160;<br><b>업그레이드 해보겠슴다!</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>아래는</b><br><b>홍익재과만, 으로다가</b><br>&#160;<br><b>위에 별거 아닌</b><br><b>단원명 한글파일과</b><br><b>물화생지 설명PPT 입니다. ^0^</b><br>&#160;<br><b>우리의 시간은 1초도 소중하니깐용!</b></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d26d451ccde9a46dba8d0ba4a8ac17d7b96923d?download\" data-file-name=\"물화생지 설명ppt.pptx\" data-file-size=\"50236\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansoftpptx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D296%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20240229222702&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4d26d451ccde9a46dba8d0ba4a8ac17d7b96923d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">물화생지 설명ppt</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">49.06KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a79baad66fe6174cd6f27510fe986a4fab12d96f?download\" data-file-name=\"첫시간_중2_단원명.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"37950\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D296%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20240229222702&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa79baad66fe6174cd6f27510fe986a4fab12d96f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">첫시간_중2_단원명</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">37.06KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
